\details{
The univariate Gaussian (\code{UVG}) family models category structure over a
single continuous cue dimension:
\deqn{p(x \mid c) = \mathcal{N}(x; \mu_c, \sigma_c^2)}

Category representations are constructed with
\link{new_uvg_category_representation} or
\link{new_uvg_category_representation_from_data}. Cognitive ideal observer
models are constructed with \link{new_uvg_ideal_observer} or
\link{new_uvg_ideal_observer_from_data}.
